      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "開けた場所に腰を下ろしたメロンさんは、\n辺りを見渡して花や動物を見つけては\n子供のようにはしゃいでいる。",
      "jp_sha256": "63415a42fa1945ae78e5076b8a407729493bb0391aa2ced0127684d2cec7a8c0",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "탁 트인 곳에 앉은 멜론 씨는\n주위를 둘러보다 꽃이나 동물을 발견할 때마다\n아이처럼 신이 나 있었다.",
      "message_index_0based": 2,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 10,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b002-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "3288b3f655e673c7def9ce6c945ce43515d3f566c20b31106da6ae1d91219974:000000_-7995349890131658561:g0:r9",
      "row_index_0based": 9,
      "serialized_row_index": 9,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "開けた場所に腰を下ろしたメロンさんは、\n辺りを見渡して花や動物を見つけては\n子供のようにはしゃいでいる。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
