      "row_index_0based": 17,
      "serialized_row_index": 17,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "だが彼女の喜びようからすれば、そんなものは些細な問題である。\n僕は踏ん張って強風や地面の揺れに耐えつつ、\nメロンさんへと声をかけた。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "c4a43d6281d16838bb963e8b5e4fb5b354bf3f3acd3bf99fa0dae9410fb31f30",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 6,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "メロンさんが楽しそうでよかったです。\n案内した甲斐がありました！",
      "jp_sha256": "5051986a28aa6253cab4342f2a68baec68904af091b6bfe460d105d2dbe18043",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "멜론 씨가 즐거워 보여서 다행이에요.\n안내한 보람이 있네요!",
      "message_index_0based": 6,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 19,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b002-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "3288b3f655e673c7def9ce6c945ce43515d3f566c20b31106da6ae1d91219974:000000_-7995349890131658561:g0:r18",
      "row_index_0based": 18,
      "serialized_row_index": 18,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "メロンさんが楽しそうでよかったです。\n案内した甲斐がありました！"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "8dc3983d54e9405e146b6d50d5657d2048067cbe715f672fffa89ec0f576a403",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 7,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "うん、私とっても楽しいよ！\nここはかわいいものや、綺麗なものがたくさんあるね！\n連れてきてくれてありがとう、ご主人さま。",
      "jp_sha256": "800c3a45c2bf6a7da287f4db8bc6c8b74fa88b97d3e177c5fd532e2a6209084f",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "응, 나 정말 즐거워!\n여기는 귀엽고 예쁜 게 잔뜩 있네!\n데려와 줘서 고마워, 주인님.",
      "message_index_0based": 7,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 21,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b002-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "3288b3f655e673c7def9ce6c945ce43515d3f566c20b31106da6ae1d91219974:000000_-7995349890131658561:g0:r20",
      "row_index_0based": 20,
      "serialized_row_index": 20,
      "source_cells": [
