    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "30311c81174cd8cd03056ccdc03e21b3694ad283f80b617fa7b2ffc1bf341dc4",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 8,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "にこりと微笑むメロンさん。\n天真爛漫な彼女を見ていると穏やかな気持ちになる。\nお礼を言いたいのはこちらの方だ。",
      "jp_sha256": "a3cd86dba87fc14b95232a50ff897fb49c83f29ef59358ef877b4924f9f6c97c",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "빙긋 미소 짓는 멜론 씨.\n천진난만한 그녀를 보고 있으면 마음이 평온해진다.\n감사를 말하고 싶은 건 오히려 내 쪽이다.",
      "message_index_0based": 8,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 22,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b002-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "3288b3f655e673c7def9ce6c945ce43515d3f566c20b31106da6ae1d91219974:000000_-7995349890131658561:g0:r21",
      "row_index_0based": 21,
      "serialized_row_index": 21,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "にこりと微笑むメロンさん。\n天真爛漫な彼女を見ていると穏やかな気持ちになる。\nお礼を言いたいのはこちらの方だ。"
      ],
      "speaker": "",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "ec01842f45fd8319ccfe3b7a09aa72c9af4f03336cb3e41a2ccf79c398546e3b",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 9,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "それにしても、メロンさんは本当に\nかわいいものが好きですよね。",
      "jp_sha256": "4edb9f4b74a912b0440eb054aa3c547726372664336d9738941c4e915b804cae",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "그런데 멜론 씨는 정말\n귀여운 걸 좋아하시네요.",
      "message_index_0based": 9,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 23,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
      "reason": "",
      "review_id": "monmusu-pro-b002-20261105-same-model-pass2-r1",
      "review_note": "",
      "review_status": "reviewed",
      "row_id": "3288b3f655e673c7def9ce6c945ce43515d3f566c20b31106da6ae1d91219974:000000_-7995349890131658561:g0:r22",
      "row_index_0based": 22,
      "serialized_row_index": 22,
      "source_cells": [
        "",
        "",
        "主人公",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "",
        "それにしても、メロンさんは本当に\nかわいいものが好きですよね。"
      ],
      "speaker": "主人公",
      "translation_status": "translated",
      "voice": ""
    },
    {
      "command": "",
      "draft_row_sha256": "4b986cae3ed73590ec4ef4a08572bf68d500ed37f548d38c57dcf5b2c25f47d7",
      "grid_index": 0,
      "grid_message_index_0based": 10,
      "header_row_index_0based": 0,
      "hold": false,
      "hold_placeholder": null,
      "inline_tags": [],
      "jp": "そうだよー。かわいいものって、見ていると\n心がほわほわして、うきうきしちゃうでしょ？\nあ、ご主人さまも、とってもかわいくて大好きだよ！",
      "jp_sha256": "c326b0682fc4efda6d5a6086fd8a6dd2388685dd55577c9b7294277250cb495b",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "ko": "맞아―. 귀여운 건 보고 있으면\n마음이 몽글몽글하고 들뜨잖아?\n아, 주인님도 정말 귀엽고 너무 좋아해!",
      "message_index_0based": 10,
      "page_ctrl": "",
      "physical_line_1based": 24,
      "policy_sha256": "b5e7fd3e9caca00c1d40cf24880559ba1b79d6fec6b53af3006698eb26c34f6b",
